  HONEST LIMITATIONS  (always disclosed, in v3.0 spirit)
========================================================================
   1. PCIe save is a mathematical estimate (subset bytes / full
      bytes), shown above to agree with measured ideal save
      typically within 0.01pp. Direct nvidia-smi dmon measurement is
      the natural next step under v3.0 Section 6 Path 6 (DC Joint
